hifiberry-shairport (5.1.1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Update Shairport Sync to upstream 5.1 (security update; classic remote
    control support restored and other fixes). Previously 5.0.1.
  * postinst: after registering the players.d ACR drop-in, remove any stale
    inline "shairport" player from audiocontrol.json. audiocontrol >= 0.7.13
    loads players.d entries as separate players, so a leftover inline
    definition duplicated this one and the second listener failed to bind UDP
    :5555, breaking AirPlay metadata.

 -- HiFiBerry <support@hifiberry.com>  Tue, 07 Jul 2026 15:34:07 +0000

hifiberry-shairport (5.0.1.3) stable; urgency=medium

  * Fix nqptp.service installation: install as system service instead of user
    service so it can obtain CAP_NET_BIND_SERVICE for PTP ports 319/320.
    Previously failed with status=218/CAPABILITIES, leaving shairport unable
    to find nqptp and silently exiting after its grace period — making the
    device invisible to AirPlay clients.
  * Use DynamicUser=yes (matching upstream nqptp.service.in); drop static
    nqptp user/group creation from postinst. Add LimitRTPRIO=6.

 -- HiFiBerry <support@hifiberry.com>  Fri, 08 May 2026 12:00:00 +0000

